@startuml IntegrationRedmine
title Redmine Integration Flow
participant MrTick
participant RedmineAdapter
participant RedmineAPI

MrTick -> RedmineAdapter: Request Sync (lastCheckpoint)
RedmineAdapter -> RedmineAPI: GET /issues.json (checkpoint)
RedmineAPI -> RedmineAdapter: JSON (issues)

RedmineAdapter -> RedmineAdapter: Map RedmineIssue -> Task
RedmineAdapter -> RedmineAdapter: Map status, tracker, priority
RedmineAdapter -> MrTick: Return Normalized Data

note over RedmineAdapter
  Conversão de metadados
  Redmine -> Padrão interno
end note
@enduml
